  {
   "id": "a17-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 937,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: an overloaded router can be an end of a path, never the middle",
   "originalText": "How it works: an overloaded router can be an end of a path, never the middle",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a17-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 64,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. SPF",
   "originalText": "1. SPF",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a17-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 200,
   "width": 962,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Dijkstra reaches an overloaded router but doesn’t relax its links, unless it is the root. Reverse SPF\ndoes the same. So dist(X,Y) is the cheapest path with no overloaded router inside it.",
   "originalText": "Dijkstra reaches an overloaded router but doesn’t relax its links, unless it is the root. Reverse SPF\ndoes the same. So dist(X,Y) is the cheapest path with no overloaded router inside it.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a17-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 253,
   "width": 745,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2. \"Path through M\" counts as ∞ when M is overloaded and in the middle",
   "originalText": "2. \"Path through M\" counts as ∞ when M is overloaded and in the middle",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a17-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 287,
   "width": 891,
   "height": 140,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Check                       Right-hand side              ∞ when\n--------------------------  ---------------------------  -----------------------------------\nAvoids link S→E (B1)        dist(X,S)+c(S,E)+dist(E,Y)   S overloaded and X ≠ S, or E overloaded and Y ≠ E\nLFA loop-free (B3)          dist(N,S)+dist(S,D)          S overloaded\nLFA node-protecting (B5)    dist(N,E)+dist(E,D)          E overloaded and D ≠ E\nP-space (B8)                c(S,E)+dist(E,Y)             E overloaded\nExtended P-space (B9)       dist(N,S)+dist(S,Y)          S overloaded\nQ-space (B10)               dist(Y,S)+c(S,E)             S overloaded",
   "originalText": "Check                       Right-hand side              ∞ when\n--------------------------  ---------------------------  -----------------------------------\nAvoids link S→E (B1)        dist(X,S)+c(S,E)+dist(E,Y)   S overloaded and X ≠ S, or E overloaded and Y ≠ E\nLFA loop-free (B3)          dist(N,S)+dist(S,D)          S overloaded\nLFA node-protecting (B5)    dist(N,E)+dist(E,D)          E overloaded and D ≠ E\nP-space (B8)                c(S,E)+dist(E,Y)             E overloaded\nExtended P-space (B9)       dist(N,S)+dist(S,Y)          S overloaded\nQ-space (B10)               dist(Y,S)+c(S,E)             S overloaded",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a17-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 437,
   "width": 181,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "3. Never a backup",
   "originalText": "3. Never a backup",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a17-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 471,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  LFA: \"S MUST NOT consider using N_i as an alternate\" (RFC 5286 §3.5), skipped with reason overload.\n•  Remote LFA: never a tunnel exit, never a PQ node (RFC 7490 §5.4). It may still be in P or Q.\n•  TI-LFA: the post-convergence SPF follows the same rule, so it is never inside the repair path.",
   "originalText": "•  LFA: \"S MUST NOT consider using N_i as an alternate\" (RFC 5286 §3.5), skipped with reason overload.\n•  Remote LFA: never a tunnel exit, never a PQ node (RFC 7490 §5.4). It may still be in P or Q.\n•  TI-LFA: the post-convergence SPF follows the same rule, so it is never inside the repair path.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a17-text-17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 545,
   "width": 405,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 134623,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1780393,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Worked: Example 1, N overloaded, S → D",
   "originalText": "Worked: Example 1, N overloaded, S → D",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a17-text-18",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 579,
   "width": 657,
   "height": 75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 142542,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1885122,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "LFA:     Via N: skipped, N has the overload bit set\nP(S) = {N}: 15 < 10+20 = 30 ✓      Q(E) = {D, N}: N 20 < 15+10 = 25 ✓\nPQ:      N is in both, but overloaded → no PQ node\nTI-LFA:  the only path left, S-N-D, passes through N → D can’t be reached",
   "originalText": "LFA:     Via N: skipped, N has the overload bit set\nP(S) = {N}: 15 < 10+20 = 30 ✓      Q(E) = {D, N}: N 20 < 15+10 = 25 ✓\nPQ:      N is in both, but overloaded → no PQ node\nTI-LFA:  the only path left, S-N-D, passes through N → D can’t be reached",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
